const skeleton = `The bakery's website shows the normal opening hours on public holidays. On 25 December it should say Closed, and on Easter Monday 9:00 to 13:00. The holiday list is in data/holidays.csv and the hours are worked out in src/hours.ts.

Done means: tests for 25 December, Easter Monday and an ordinary Tuesday pass, the whole test suite passes, and you show me a screenshot of the page for 25 December.

Don't change how the normal hours are worked out, and don't add a library. Stop and ask me only if the holiday list itself looks wrong, or a test fails for a reason you can't explain.`;

