- Install: pnpm install
- Run one test file: pnpm vitest run path/to/file.test.ts
- Check everything: pnpm test && pnpm typecheck

# Things the code won't tell you
- Opening hours come from src/hours.ts; the holiday list in data/holidays.csv is edited by hand every December
- Dates in the holiday list are written 25/12/2026, everywhere else 2026-12-25
